            <title><![CDATA[速递｜Google首席科学家、Gemini项目负责人Jeff Dean离职创业，创办AI科学发现公司Discovery Loop]]></title>
            <link>https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RlcBZN1T2a-1qVkX_1AItQ</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">d3c28d6a10a2703a935dbf589bd19a4b</guid>
